==Battleground==
*10 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 13.33~33.33 seconds<sup>400f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

